* Lead the conceptual design phase to select the machine-s architecture; influence the development team and prove that the solution will meet the requirements;
* Define the qualifications plan of the prototype; run the testing and analyze the results; present and commission the product at customers- facilities;
* Participate in activities of products- sustaining; define the production tests and their acceptance criteria;
* Strong expertise with concrete achievements in servo regulation for motion control, mechatronics engineering; knowledge of metrology and optics is an asset;
* Define project scope, deliverables and acceptance criteria;
* Follow up and technical guidance of the development team to ensure accurate, efficient and timely achievement of the defined development objectives.
##### Your profile #####
* Master degree in control or mechatronics engineering;
* Ideally 5 years in a similar position;
* Strong understanding of physical phenomena (e.g. mechanical and electronics coupling, vibration dynamics, thermo-mechanics);
* Proficient with MATLAB/SIMULINK;
* Good knowledge of real-time applications and programming languages: C, C++;
* Strong understanding of dynamic systems control;
* Autonomous, Team work ability; Strong analytical thinking;
* Good communication skills, fluent in English (able to be exposed to the worldwide customers).

